# Claude Code Prompt — Implement AI-Native Travel Packages & Deals System for TravelAI

Implement a premium AI-native travel packages and deals platform for TravelAI.

This should become one of the core features of the platform.

The experience should combine:

* Expedia vacation package structure
* Booking.com pricing clarity
* Airbnb storytelling
* AI-native conversational planning
* modern Gen Z / Gen Alpha UX

This is NOT a traditional “tour package website”.

The experience should feel like:

```txt
an intelligent AI travel planner
```

that can:

* recommend packages
* personalize trips
* customize itineraries
* build trips conversationally
* optimize budget automatically

